{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b199c6d84cd2cbf66aedc17dc0c22f2b9e3ef5129c0771af24dd018a2cd4261", "ja": "（今日はPV撮影だ。本番前、百合子は台本を\n真剣に読み込んでいるけど……）", "zh": "（今天要拍PV。正式拍摄前，百合子正在认真地读剧本，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "3538b143f68aa7a7064ef8e35eb8d97a98e0e6e7612cc672b541fbe8437fb456", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。ちょっと\nお聞きしたいことがあるんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我有件事想请教您……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ebfc104d00af7e61331443a66f4a3262171e8fd508c2503f2eed076526aff327", "ja": "ああ、どうかしたのか？\n今のうちに、なんでも聞いてくれ！", "zh": "啊，怎么了？\n趁现在，有什么想问的尽管问吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "c5af15baf49f3cab41ffec7ceb25213c4108e2447d32de29806ba9d51654dc5d", "ja": "あの……{$P$}さんは、\n分身してみたいと思いませんか？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，您有没有想过试试分身？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4b596346026a27c91cce364fbad9b32de9764a5a3ec7af52f68171dfc6a8f820", "ja": "……え？\nぶ、分身……？", "zh": "……咦？\n分、分身……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "82ba77f0168c124388fb2d1591d84bd2fdecfeb193046e5a4f2bb33e81044994", "ja": "はい。今回のPV、CGを使って\nふたりの私が登場しますよね？", "zh": "是的。这次的PV里，使用了CG，会有两个我登场，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "783e577bf6a0480c5318e7ef1d6d5611d9565c64d3cac1772be93cc8ce255191", "ja": "もうひとりの自分、内なる存在……そんな分身を\n自在に操れたらって……憧れますよね！", "zh": "另一个自己、内在的存在……要是能随意\n操控这样的分身……会让人很向往吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dc2db6e86287c7fe275abb9e9ab4cdf7bd728af573abb4a8c6b76549f89569e7", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか……そうだな。\n確かに分身できたら、便利だと思うけど。", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事……确实如此。\n要是能分身，确实会很方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "1b7f5d6d35ebae98dca17d9c7df2d1e5ffff978c87908e3ddf00cc888177160a", "ja": "はい！　部屋にあるうず高い積読の山も、\n分身がいればきっと切り崩せますし……。", "zh": "是的！要是有分身的话，房间里那堆高高的待读书籍，肯定也能一点点看完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1009_p", "source_sha256": "43e18fdcb061e1664f9cc5e5ced9cabdc02a26c9236592ee0fcd4a7a062f6284", "ja": "意外と日常的な使い方なんだな……。\nまぁ俺も、人の事は言えないけど。", "zh": "没想到还真是挺日常的用法啊……\n不过，我也没资格说别人就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1010_p", "source_sha256": "afb44823c41cac15fe2b490b73e77b31b60bbb3f5c480949c7e0ff71cef216a1", "ja": "忙しい時、体がふたつあればいいのにって\n思った事は何度もあるからな。", "zh": "因为我也好几次在忙的时候想过，\n要是能有两个身体就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "7305d39720883da00984aed375ceb602c1e134efc5ff32a7ee8101a96a945355", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、\nふたり……ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生有\n两个……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8b55f4d34f05b483082aa17c42073d4383b05a18170228ca3537bc39a2f9cc47", "ja": "ああ。そうすれば事務仕事をしながら、\n百合子の撮影にも余裕で付き添えるからな。", "zh": "对。那样一来，我就能一边处理事务工作，一边从容地陪百合子去拍摄了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "9755d7973c484172d03e74a9708295444906868693f47f75c2acf775684d7091", "ja": "{$P$}さんが……\nわ、私に、付きっきりで！？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n全、全程陪着我！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "e2b332e8f3fafaca9579b0bf6bf08a2b7977478d9f40d7b7d513777ea02e3511", "ja": "だ、ダメですそんなの！　付きっきりなんて、\nダメに決まってるじゃありませんか！", "zh": "不、不行啊！怎么能那样！一直陪着我什么的，\n当然不行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "3e75f7c228b006a4dfeb69c9cdded05ca5c652c9cae2ee62434c117979a34615", "ja": "昼も夜も、家でも劇場でも、ずっと一緒だなんて……\nもしかして、私を徹底攻略するつもりですか！？", "zh": "白天也好、夜晚也好，在家也好、在剧场也好，一直待在一起……\n该不会是打算彻底攻略我吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1016_p", "source_sha256": "eb6ac5143eb2c3890134d43a112a42ec4545c767f455bb3305f06ff1fa518392", "ja": "いや、流石にそこまでは……。というか、\nPVについての質問だったんじゃ……？", "zh": "不，再怎么说也不至于到那种地步……话说回来，\n刚才不是在问有关PV的事吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "4e26c940112ac0f509e5e81e5ef682a0751d9553495f7f61bf2e523b489d21cb", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！\nあの……私、ちょっと心を落ち着かせてきます！", "zh": "没、没关系！\n那个……我先去让自己冷静一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1018_p", "source_sha256": "6a17dd95309d4bbf82d06b81ed5644c7ff6a1adb80b6e34320469bf25e5ab5f6", "ja": "お、おーい、百合子！　もうすぐ本番だから、\nあまり遠くまで行かないようにな……！", "zh": "喂、喂——百合子！马上就要正式拍摄了，\n别走得太远啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0204_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ca1add1f3e1c4d3206ec3ffce4afc0788009eab9903cc697ce082057d421b287", "ja": "（その後のPV撮影は、恋に悩む百合子の表情が\nリアルでよかったと好評だった。よかったな！）", "zh": "（之后的PV拍摄中，百合子为恋爱烦恼的表情十分真实，获得了大家的好评。太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
